WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.125
- [Rodgers:] Welcome back to the playoffs.

00:00:01.125 --> 00:00:03.291
We've got matchups so good, they must be scripted.

00:00:03.291 --> 00:00:04.250
Wake up sheeple.

00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:06.791
- Yes, I'm simply buzzing with excitement.

00:00:06.791 --> 00:00:08.625
- [Rodgers:] In one corner, we have the Ravens.

00:00:08.625 --> 00:00:11.625
- I have waited three long years
to get a playoff win.

00:00:11.625 --> 00:00:12.250
And I’ll be-

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:12.875
Huh?

00:00:13.625 --> 00:00:15.625
- [Belichick:] My god, it’s CJ Stroud's music.

00:00:15.625 --> 00:00:17.125
The phenom is here.

00:00:19.041 --> 00:00:21.125
- THAT’S MY THING. Come and get it.

00:00:23.416 --> 00:00:25.250
- [Rodgers:] Looks like the Ravens are making a run.

00:00:25.416 --> 00:00:27.250
- [Belichick:] A Likely story.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.000
And it has Stroud distracted.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:33.500
- [Rodgers:] And the Texans Cinderella
story comes to an end.

00:00:34.291 --> 00:00:35.750
- [Belichick:] We also have the Chiefs again.

00:00:37.625 --> 00:00:39.500
- Tables, ladders, and chairs.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:40.375
- Oh my.

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:42.250
- SACRIFICE... TO THE PIT!

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:46.416
- [Rodgers:] Travis may be spending too much time exploring new heights. 

00:00:46.416 --> 00:00:48.500
- [Belichick:] Here come the D.K. Brothers.

00:00:50.041 --> 00:00:52.041
- [Rodgers:] Oh, and they landed wide right!

00:00:52.041 --> 00:00:52.791
Chiefs win!

00:00:53.125 --> 00:00:57.125
- [Belichick:] One of these teams will win the very easy crown of AFC Champion.

00:00:57.125 --> 00:00:59.125
- Aaron, buddy, I'm the wrestling guy.

00:00:59.125 --> 00:00:59.750
- Sorry, Pat.

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:00.666
I'm like a vampire.

00:01:00.666 --> 00:01:02.750
Once you invite me
in, I will ruin your life.

00:01:03.041 --> 00:01:05.625
- [Rodgers:] In our co-main event, we have the Niners.

00:01:05.791 --> 00:01:08.041
- Can you smell what the Brock is cooking?

00:01:08.041 --> 00:01:10.375
- I can smell what the people
around you are cookin’.

00:01:12.125 --> 00:01:13.125
- [Rodgers:] Niners win!

00:01:13.125 --> 00:01:14.916
You know, I actually could’ve recovered from that.

00:01:15.416 --> 00:01:18.000
- Look who's in the f--king Conference
Championship.

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:20.375
- I don't want to hear how f--king hard you’ve had it.

00:01:20.375 --> 00:01:22.375
- They said I wasn't good enough for f--king Cleveland.

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:24.250
- Uh oh, Vita Vea!

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:26.125
- The run stops HERE!

00:01:26.166 --> 00:01:28.250
- TAKE ME INSTEAD OF MY PRECIOUS JARED!

00:01:29.041 --> 00:01:32.041
- [Belichick:] Lions win, but they're having a little too much fun for my taste.

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:35.541
- [Rodgers:] And the Niners will once again
attempt to lose an NFC Championship.

00:01:38.833 --> 00:01:41.708
- [Announcer:] Passenger Josh Allen, please report to the Cancun gate

00:01:41.708 --> 00:01:44.625
while Coach McDermott is held by airport security.

00:01:46.583 --> 00:01:50.333
Attention Flight 58
to the Cancun section of Gridiron Heights.

00:01:50.458 --> 00:01:52.208
We are now boarding all veterans.

00:01:52.208 --> 00:01:53.750
All playoff loss veterans,

00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:54.875
you are now free to board.

